    "intro_html":  "There is a kind of cooking where you brown one thing, dump everything else in a pot, put the lid on, and walk away for four hours. That is this. Turkey, rice, enchilada sauce, beans, corn and peppers all cook together in the slow cooker, and cheese goes on at the very end. Each serving lands at 565 calories with \u003cstrong\u003e29 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$2.08\u003c/strong\u003e. It is the easiest fourteen-serving batch in this entire collection.",
